{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "bd12b0dffbac7b168f0c1084d94d53e242f6607a7a1c23497a1484c484345022", "ja": "お姫さまたちのお風呂", "zh": "公主们的入浴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3963fbff87f6de73bfdaca1d512647b142ddec22ed176adcfa4e3a0d0ac0ef9", "ja": "レッスン後、銭湯に行ってきたエミリー達。\nエミリーが公演の抱負を語ると、なぜか\n記者会見ごっこが始まり、姫君達は公演の\n意気込みを語る。お互いの熱意にあてられた\nみんなは、レッスン場へ駆け出していく。", "zh": "训练结束之后，艾蜜莉等人前去澡堂沐浴。\n艾蜜莉在表达自己对公演的抱负时，\n不知为何开始了一场模拟记者会，\n公主们一一诉说自己的决心。\n众人被彼此的热诚感染，再次向着练习室而去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4954e7b821adc0a1fe8c5e1053e238c6cbac446329b892e2d2c28398dba3105b", "ja": "（未来達の発案で、Princessチームは\n劇場で強化合宿を行うことになった！）", "zh": "（由于未来她们的提议，Princess队\n确定将在剧场进行强化集训！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f8ed9126565f8a8e333e32b1a69cbf94f0a37578a93fdcd60947242489929fcc", "ja": "（自由参加・自由帰宅という形式だが、参加率は高い。\n今日のレッスンを終えた後も、みんな一緒に……）", "zh": "（虽是自由参加、自由回家的形式，但参加率相当高。\n今天的训练结束后，大家也一起……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "b17633b2256eefd8d914524c3cc3400dac4d7f28b0fccf465c7ccbffd33e1e62", "ja": "はぁ～。ええ湯やったわ～♪\nやっぱり、レッスンの後の銭湯は最高やんな！", "zh": "呼～真棒的浴池啊～♪\n果然练习以后泡个澡最赞啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "b46ec1cf1b6dceffe2c62ea6ee57d7ba60d03cd9ec7b0b45f5eef31ff9a848e3", "ja": "アイドルちゃん達とのお風呂……。\nはぁ～、夢のようなひと時でしたぁ……。ずびっ。", "zh": "跟偶像宝贝们一起泡澡……\n呼～这一刻简直就像在做梦一样……吱哔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "2dad33eea2df2ec8ce0e125a0523d01fc7df291592c2a69c42bc5d7dbdb2c491", "ja": "私も感動しました！　銭湯にはいつか行ってみたいと\n思っていたのですが、なかなか機会がなくて……", "zh": "我也很感动！我从以前就很想来澡堂泡澡，\n但一直找不到机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "baa5321b6cf225d1069f0d7e2eff66e4c1db5f8937a6dfdd17b4445e701d73d2", "ja": "お帰り、みんな。\nこんなところで何をしているんだ？", "zh": "欢迎回来，大家。\n你们凑在这里做什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "ade359246780afe52a5899b4a262102c9f379fb425b0f744fe3dbdc00be19149", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ただいまなのです！\n姫達は、ここで涼んでいるのですよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，公主我们回来了喔！\n公主我们正在这里纳凉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "57a366bb7871f3e56dfa2b360f9842cf898391f4a850d8652532039709b38a9f", "ja": "みんな、お銭湯でちょっぴりはしゃぎすぎて、\nちょっぴりのぼせてしまったのです♪", "zh": "大家在澡堂不小心玩得太兴奋，\n结果有点泡晕头了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "32454bcffa6bafede00cb2c009d4a4a2790fa68635860f2772b9a41edc732e4e", "ja": "そうか、湯冷めに気を付けるんだぞ。", "zh": "这样啊，要小心别着凉啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "cd6cc75aa4a6d518c97ed3aff40aee740a2f57061803f89d8abe4ec386922a2d", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、銭湯とは本当に素晴らしい文化ですね！\n美しい富士山の壁画を背に、様々な湯船があって……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生，澡堂真是美妙的文化啊！\n墙上有美丽的富士山壁画，还有各式各样的浴池……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "ed0e793ff47584c91776eaeb6108601cbc7554253e43491ad1398d7c03c445d7", "ja": "なにより、湯がけの作法に感動です！　後からお湯を\n使う方への、思いやりの心……。まさに和の心です！", "zh": "最让我感动的是，入浴时的礼仪！\n充满了对下一位使用者的体贴之情……这就是大和之心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "49f51bdb4409eebccbdb1da382b5db3bfab774e5d81542756f55e5086b5d75db", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。\nとにかく、楽しめたみたいで何よりだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是这样啊。\n你们玩得开心就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "2eb99972b31c46ec926488389bff623854f2585d5fd8d30d5c6a287d033e0db6", "ja": "はい、とっても！\n奈緒さん、誘ってくださってありがとうございました♪", "zh": "是的，我非常开心！\n奈绪，谢谢你邀请我一起泡澡♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "3e7b5b90a3e1555bbd8bdebb80afa49fe437ff2b2a513f2ec17cb303f9291ba4", "ja": "私の方こそ、ありがとうな♪\nそんなに喜んでもらえると、なんやうれしいわ～。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你啦♪\n看你高兴成这样，我也很开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "5ac2be46403f4f540a31ca762f8f1e04e4cf1f2ecd583f1efde411571c3ff60f", "ja": "お湯に浸かったみなさまの、幸せそうな顔を見て、\n私、気持ちを新たにしました！", "zh": "看到大家泡澡时的幸福表情，\n我有了全新的体悟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "ddbe2d4fa25e59bf2b9ea0791147ad148efe602b409d2e2306ebd38f77174883", "ja": "姫君公演では、ごヒイキ様方にも、\nあんな笑顔になってもらえるよう頑張りますっ！", "zh": "公主公演时，我要努力让主顾们\n也露出那样幸福的笑脸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "894bc4ec3e8afc8c378452e03e21aeee18260f00dee3f400081e7038633cdb24", "ja": "フムフム。あたたかいお湯に包まれるかのような、\n癒しの公演……ということですね？", "zh": "嗯嗯，意思就是要办一场像是泡在温暖浴池里的\n疗愈公演……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "a9ada8897d312a0e390567c23d66728bad95694668e1332776287333d5232185", "ja": "大丈夫、エミリーちゃんならできます！　たくさんの\nアイドルちゃんを見てきたありさが保証しますよっ！", "zh": "别担心，亚利沙相信艾蜜莉一定行的！\n看过许多偶像宝贝的亚利沙拍胸脯保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "28df1c7ea0cf22865b3a3132c62e4410e755f327120f4f6e58e9afa632d6b8bd", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……えへへ♪\nあの、亜利沙さんは、どんな舞台にしたいのですか？", "zh": "谢、谢谢你……嘿嘿♪\n请问，亚利沙想要打造什么样的舞台呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "ffb67a8621fec503b48c1e4219531233cf44639420689d1e1e83e66a83bce477", "ja": "え、ありさですか？\nえっと……そうですね、ありさは……", "zh": "咦？你说亚利沙吗？\n呃……这个嘛，亚利沙想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "54409f0e0ee15ffa74aafcac2831b4da6b497ac7d8e939582b64e3b94f9d53ac", "ja": "はい、お教えくださいっ！\n姫君公演に向けた、亜利沙さんの今のお気持ちを！", "zh": "是，麻烦告诉我！\n亚利沙现在对于公主公演有什么想法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "d77322a0a4b15602b7d4fc96a1d82698ac643d1bb3aedb924185cfd60fe94236", "ja": "あ、ありさの今の気持ちは……。\nエミリーちゃんの、シャンプーの香りが……！", "zh": "亚、亚利沙现在的想法……\n闻到了艾蜜莉的洗发精香气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "93b0c2dd40b95bd22a6eb428bc7d588c4318f5124435ed92f20a4154357ac732", "ja": "はぁ～っ、ありさの自制心がピンチですっ！\nまつりちゃん、助けてください～っ！", "zh": "唉～亚利沙的自制力陷入危机了！\n茉莉，快来帮帮亚利沙啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "e8bd0c08eeee44114a66cf7f175a54594bcc8a7d76f41b5934ab6057a6a6035f", "ja": "ほ？　わかりました、姫におまかせなのです。\nでは……今から記者会見を始めるのです！", "zh": "哦？明白了，就交给公主的喔。\n那么……现在开始举行记者会的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "e77c1eb350f2ad89f82ecd728d7ada96386cc0948b874b3d6f8fbf1d2a4afb46", "ja": "アイドルたる者、いついかなる時にも、\n質問には笑顔で答えられなければいけません。……ね？", "zh": "身为偶像之人，不论何时何地，\n都要有能力面露笑容回答他人的问题……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ce8ef8ca0e533790ed3b51baf696faf842d54f9d0418d1ce74e9208fff94a25b", "ja": "はは、そうだな。突然の質問に\n即興でコメントする能力も、アイドルには大切だぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，的确，对突如其来的问题\n即席发表意见，这个能力对偶像而言也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "5a338eedf963fe8902a632fff148e3ca748978a32934eae1f66f50d2c8c2351f", "ja": "そうなのです。亜利沙ちゃんが今、エミリーちゃんに\nちゃんと答えられなかったのは、練習不足なのです。", "zh": "就是这样的喔。小亚利沙刚刚回答不出\n小艾蜜莉的问题，就代表练习得不够的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "9a9b9a7538b684eb24b292d1ad3d76d0b14102d8c8979099125ccaf31ea3481c", "ja": "た、確かに……！\nありさが甘かったです……！", "zh": "确、确实有理……！\n是亚利沙太天真了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "2b0e6d4b4644676fe1dbb21f20e01302fd93602c9c9a0f7b5943075ad1c91d47", "ja": "というわけで、練習あるのみなのです！　こほんっ。\nそちら、765プロの横山奈緒さんなのです？", "zh": "所以呢，大家要好好练习一下的喔！咳！\n请问那位是765艺能的横山奈绪小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "b4fa447af8aa5d5e9d2efabe412dffe9b313fdf31a64ef79c405532b3fcc19cf", "ja": "え、私！？", "zh": "咦！叫我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "ae673157c49a3dca9596cfe85c4793820dc977b15d90a1b5ebcde1600b28b9b9", "ja": "当然なのです。抜き打ちインタビューなのです。", "zh": "当然的喔，这可是突击采访的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "4db3876487a631feabb026050062e23c159294bd9fe0c64b6cdbde94e397b592", "ja": "奈緒さん、Fairy、Angelと好評でしたが、\nPrincessの公演の自信はどうなのです？", "zh": "奈绪小姐，Fairy和Angel都大受好评，\n请问您对Princess的公演是否有信心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "d6b8609e2bd2774986e1da9b8e672600fc27ab1a8675cf3c41dce41c46fcd6c5", "ja": "え、ええと、そうやな～……。", "zh": "呃，这个嘛，我想想～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "20fd16b2daa9a77a3e1c8a7b4cfccbb5745aaef1891952ecd88617dfe6387779", "ja": "はっ！　インタビューといえばカメラマン……。\n奈緒ちゃん、こっちに視線ください！　パシャパシャ！", "zh": "啊！说到采访就需要摄影师……\n奈绪，请看这边！咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1038_032emi", "source_sha256": "cb1f9c6bed29d848eff020b2f3d5864391bba1e877669889eeeaf28c9adab8a5", "ja": "まあ、亜利沙さんが一瞬にして写真家の方に……！？", "zh": "哎呀，亚利沙一瞬间就化身为影像拍摄家……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "1a6b31974a6095a81579f3c27078d0774e08075a9532a53533563321e20f2eaa", "ja": "亜利沙……。生き生きしとるなぁ……。", "zh": "亚利沙……看起来神采奕奕的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "5af57a1a7e7e05581733b41c05d95ddac3fecedfcb7949c0ee48098c7e1194e7", "ja": "さあ、奈緒ちゃん！　公演へのぱわほー！な思いを\nインタビューにぶつけるのです！", "zh": "来吧，小奈绪！在记者会上释放\n你对公演的强大意念吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "be349a939d3416ea71f9566deb81819bd96d34048adc5ec3da20be03df1baacf", "ja": "も、もちろん！　FairyとAngelに\n負けないものにする自信はありますよ～！", "zh": "这、这是当然！我有自信\n不会输给Fairy和Angel的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "1ecc8028d4d6c8f7a89e95031bf45c1d1a5280c570a982f3308e03bd8f16d73b", "ja": "今までで一番盛り上がる公演にしてみせるから、\nみんな、期待しててな～っ！", "zh": "我们会完成史上气氛最热烈的公演，\n大家要好好期待喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "3e9d1b6c1a7f1d9d9472242b9b1b9bee186b42770bf568ff9b6ce5f3184d761f", "ja": "（これは……。\n本当に、いい練習になってるんじゃないか？）", "zh": "（看起来……\n这练习好像真的很有帮助？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1044_021mat", "source_sha256": "e847d819da201546bdde9931106c4e0c271ed634d266439e1467a9cdb7ee148e", "ja": "ばっちぐーなのです！　では、つづいて……\n亜利沙さん、公演の見どころを教えてくれますか？", "zh": "非常好的喔！那么，接着……\n有请亚利沙小姐，可以说说这次公演最大的看头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "3298ef48a3b3da85a7b227df5623a628eda33ac7d4062cda7cf2b2983cc2dd68", "ja": "はっ、カメラマン役は終了ですか！？\nちょ、ちょっと待ってくださいね。……こほん。", "zh": "啊！扮演摄影师的工作已经结束了吗！？\n等、等亚利沙一下喔……咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "d644e47e5978fa0431576036d706e7630aa56b10d33691facea060cb734fa16f", "ja": "えっと、公演の見どころは……。\nやっぱり、アイドルちゃん達です！", "zh": "这个嘛，公演最大的看头……\n当然是，偶像宝贝们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1047_028ari", "source_sha256": "f1d80858e73caf11b65e4a9fb96233c8c8fc11051f536d48ad23a15e8f9995a9", "ja": "ステージのアイドルちゃん達は、現代のPrincess！\nこれは目が離せませんよ～っ！　ムフフ♪", "zh": "站在舞台上的偶像宝贝们，是现代的Princess！\n令人目不转睛呀～！唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1048_037nao", "source_sha256": "8f0fcacde7d65870e4f2f6038b1d932ff1673306e6e85cd1553f0400fd510fa4", "ja": "お、めっちゃ楽しそうやん♪　ほな交代しよ、交代♪\nあーあー、まつりさん、新曲について教えてください！", "zh": "喔，感觉超好玩的啦♪欸欸，我们交棒一下，交棒♪\n呃～嗯～茉莉小姐，请您谈谈这次的新歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "d5e17ef9f6472b8686a3d79ffb3223463de8c8c43a25bb3cf27074eee53c5a83", "ja": "とびきり・きゅーと！　な曲なのです。\n早くみんなのお耳にお届けしたいのですよ♪", "zh": "是一首非～常可爱的曲子的喔！\n真希望能早点让大家听到呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1050_037nao", "source_sha256": "e9852a5fdb5738028caf89e81aaa6e55c63fab9aa6748d18b7ae2a8c06e3c6a8", "ja": "おお、一瞬で切り返すとは……。\nさすがやな、まつり！", "zh": "哦喔，一瞬间就回答了问题……\n真不愧是茉莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1051_028ari", "source_sha256": "08c5ebff7adfa31cddaee70d8c54786d6079b57887c1b34740b00a7b688dd66c", "ja": "じゃあ最後に、エミリーちゃん！　カメラの向こうの\nファンに、極上のスマイルお願いします～っ！", "zh": "那么最后，有请艾蜜莉！\n麻烦给镜头后面的粉丝来一个最棒的笑容～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1052_032emi", "source_sha256": "779d7a361d481794fe240a5908caf3abdaca7e4c18b44de4227ea9bacb54f7e2", "ja": "あ、はいっ！　えっと……。", "zh": "啊，好的！我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "bd56bd8bde9ae556859597291f3a81a3d035378ade60565171c85ca621ffa783", "ja": "……にこっ♪", "zh": "……（微笑♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1054_028ari", "source_sha256": "c4185b6f6eee96f8daec81aec6733e8981571c4869dae81ce3e1665be23a6cd8", "ja": "ふぉぉぉぉっ！？　まさに極上の笑顔！！\nありがとうございます！　ありがとうございます！！", "zh": "呼喔喔喔喔喔！？真的是棒到不能再棒的笑容！！\n谢谢你！真是太谢谢你了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1055_037nao", "source_sha256": "598f95997e6fc728980822446ac41f9872d0c1a27b95fdfc05ca889b24b58efa", "ja": "あははっ、なんや遊んでたら、\n気分が盛り上がって来たなぁ～。", "zh": "啊哈哈，这样闹着闹着，\n感觉整个人都嗨起来了吼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1056_037nao", "source_sha256": "8bc79c2fed472c49b111f056f664ec4bce92b60150e51afa36ae3a265ad6bfdc", "ja": "なぁ、みんな。風呂上りでなんやけど……\n今から1曲、軽く合わせてみたりせえへん？", "zh": "欸，各位，虽然才刚洗完澡……\n要不要试着合一首歌看看啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1057_032emi", "source_sha256": "8ed04fbd86d8814a56996b01db1d669292abd997e75a5a1551f4dce1439b5464", "ja": "あっ、私もそう思っていました！　どんな舞台に\nしたいか話をしていたら、練習をしたくなってきて！", "zh": "啊，我也有这个想法！\n聊到对舞台的想法之后，就想继续练习了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1058_028ari", "source_sha256": "5cfe9b15666aea829b29bda3476d44ef76f8c91bd1b73ea8389aeb873250e363", "ja": "ありさもです！　汗をかいたら、また銭湯に\n行けばいいんですよ！　ムフッ♪", "zh": "亚利沙也是！反正流汗的话，\n再去澡堂就好了！唔呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1059_037nao", "source_sha256": "e3de0573e855e7cb691681b0be2c26032e9d20106cfee509ff1171ac932ca498", "ja": "というわけで、{$P$}さん！\nレッスンルーム、使ってもいいですか？", "zh": "事情就是这样，{$P$}先生！\n我们可以借用练习室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_1060", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9b1f2f8afa23470ca8b6bbf318094a68125a87702c9624ad0744e82750fbb2f1", "ja": "もちろん、そのための合宿だからな。\nでも明日に響かないよう、軽く1曲だけ。わかったか？", "zh": "当然可以，集训的目的就是这个啊。\n但为了不影响到明天，就只能练一首歌，知道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b74eb556a669531c1789e0b59935ee479f590bd7107e39d24aec3a81095973cb", "ja": "はーい！（なのです！）", "zh": "好～！（的喔！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2003_032emi", "source_sha256": "ca939ab70d11ce9f42cdad68a37966a8c39bce476d08726b4fc30639aa18c93a", "ja": "はいっ♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2004_021mat", "source_sha256": "2065742061fb8f051a7506c5e99a667dffa15391558d646688dd5c63d6c158f4", "ja": "はーい、なのです♪", "zh": "好～的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2005_p", "source_sha256": "2af8259a637ac3b5cd74013a082090947c3758caef03a5b1b994131a9c030ccf", "ja": "（笑い合いながら、レッスンルームに向かっていく。\n突然始まったリハーサルは、もう少し続くらしい）", "zh": "（她们笑着走向练习室。\n看来这场突然开始的排练，还会再持续一下子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0017_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0017_story_03_2006_p", "source_sha256": "ba33589e0692300da14f514a8664b547c2b1dbf7009e6cb61a59ab6a7bc63aaf", "ja": "（夢に向かって、ひたすら進み続けるプリンセス。\nあとで、お休みの時間を知らせに行くか）", "zh": "（公主们朝着梦想不断前进。\n等会再去提醒她们休息的时间吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
